ement.\\n\\nFor a middle-aged subject, use realistic posture and natural pacing.\\n\\nFor an elderly person, use believable slower movements, realistic posture, natural walking speed, and age-appropriate body language without exaggeration.\\n\\nFor younger subjects, keep all actions ordinary, safe, non-sexualized, and appropriate for their age.\\n\\nBACKGROUND:\\n\\nPeople around the subject continue normal activities.\\n\\nPedestrians walk naturally.\\n\\nPeople talk, sit, eat, use their phones, wait, shop, or pass by.\\n\\nNobody intentionally looks into the camera.\\n\\nDo not make background people freeze.\\n\\nUse natural environmental movement such as wind moving clothing, hair, tree leaves, curtains, traffic, shadows, or nearby objects.\\n\\nLIGHTING:\\n\\nnatural daylight or realistic indoor available light,\\n\\nordinary phone-camera dynamic range,\\n\\nrealistic shadows,\\n\\nrealistic skin texture,\\n\\nnatural clothing texture,\\n\\nno artificial studio lighting.\\n\\nThe final result should look like a real person discree\",\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/asb/ANqvLOYVgse5IKN4zYDKsFG8s2Zn9kZoBT1MZRcS4hrgZeD-Bi-toQDhI5YmyshrPN4Ba634Qru_2l-r5n09hiEYX_XE0iFL4mMHqeyOBrrh7aH3jwgcT12hRjPde9Qa2shHDX0TVKaI4WKTjuiDy4y-e_v8rDT5BAa5uR1Gt-XEWQ\",null,null,null,\"abra_r2v_10s\",\"\",null,false,1],[null,null,[10]],[\"8eb41f86-bae8-4452-b5bb-39406e6343ee\"],null,null,[\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/asb/ANqvLOYVgse5IKN4zYDKsFG8s2Zn9kZoBT1MZRcS4hrgZeD-Bi-toQDhI5YmyshrPN4Ba634Qru_2l-r5n09hiEYX_XE0iFL4mMHqeyOBrrh7aH3jwgcT12hRjPde9Qa2shHDX0TVKaI4WKTjuiDy4y-e_v8rDT5BAa5uR1Gt-XEWQ\"]]],[\"97a99d3e-45eb-4dd0-a6bd-d3dc4296110f\",\"22d33fe3-5afe-4106-8913-dc66336677f8\",\"6fbe51e4-6fc8-4e21-ae55-17f618d5a3ad\",null,null,[[1791882757,238973000],\"Create a highly realistic vertical 9:16 smartphone video that feels like it was secretly and casually recorded by another person standing behind the main character.\\n\\nThe camera must always stay behind the main character, as 